    <string name="support_heading">Support FloatPicture 2</string>
    <string name="support_intro">Maintained and improved by G1NsY. Thank you for making FloatPicture 2 part of your creative workflow.</string>
    <string name="support_alipay_title">Support via Alipay</string>
    <string name="support_optional_message">If FloatPicture 2 helps you, you can voluntarily support its continued development and maintenance. Give only what you are comfortable with.\n\nSupport does not unlock extra features, exclusive content or services. All app features work the same whether or not you contribute.</string>
